WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
It was a status to date a football player who was a star?

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.860
Oh, definitely; definitely.

3
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.060
Yes.

4
00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.220
You know, that was important . . .

5
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:07.920
Yes.

6
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:08.840
. . . to be seen.

7
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:14.540
Did you all hang out in the quad or . . . just seen walking across campus with them or . . . ?

8
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:19.240
Well, you would see . . . You would know who they were, but they usually had girlfriends,

9
00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.620
you know, so . . . I don’t know that they hung out any particular place.

10
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:29.020
One place I heard that they did go, and a lot of girls were trying to get into this class, was Ballroom Dancing.

11
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:34.460
The football players used to take ballroom dancing.

12
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:41.100
It was almost like a ballet and it was for them to learn to move agilely and slowly.

13
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.820
It was to exercise their muscles in a different type of way from what they were used to at training.
